        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Yehova wacu kumae: Nen, abimio adhura maeni i cing’ Jukaldayo, man i cing’ Nebukadrezar m’ubimo mi Babeli e ebimake: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man Jukaldayo, m’ukiedo kum adhura maeni, gibibino man gibicwinyo adhura maeni ku mac, man gibiwang’e, karacelo ku udi ma githiero udok ma ng’wice ng’ar ni Bal i wie, man ma gikonjo lam m’amadha ni mungu mange i wie, kara unyai ng’ecwiny i ia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum nyithindho mir Israel ku nyithindho mi Yuda gitimo gin ma rac kwa i wang’a ugambre i aradu migi; kum nyithindho mir Israel ginyayu ng’ecwiny kwa i ia ku tic m’i cing’gi, Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum adhura maeni bedo ira ni gin ma nyayu ng’ecwiny para man kwinyo para gambre i ceng’ ma gigome cil i ceng’ ma tin; kara akabe kud i nyim wang’a, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum ma rac ceke mi nyithindho mir Israel man mi nyithindho pa Yuda, ma gitimo kara ginyai ko ng’ecwiny i ia, gin, kud ubimo migi, man judongomawijo migi, ku julam migi, man jubila migi, ku dhanu mi Yuda, man ju m’ubedo i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giloko ira ng’ec, wang’ re ngo: man kadok aponjogi, m’aai ko pir aponjogi de, ento giciko ithgi ngo kara gijol ponji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
